    74	The third seat found that codex evaluated the per-momentum spinor trace in the rest frame and pulled it out of the
    75	momentum integral as a constant. Tori re-derived that claim rather than accepting it (`K3S2_tori_verify.py`,
    76	output `K3S2_tori_verify.out`):
