    18	For N uncorrelated, randomly oriented spin-½ particles in volume V, the ensemble average of the SQUARE of the macroscopic spin
    19	density is (¾)·n/V (operator-ordered; ¼·n/V as a c-number), linear in n: cross terms between particles vanish because the mean spin
