Hehl, von der Heyde, and Kerlick have used the spin-
ﬂuid approximation of fermionic matter, sijk ¼ sijuk and
sijuj ¼ 0, to show that the spin-density contribution to
Tik þ Uik behaves like a stiff matter with ~ ¼ ~p ¼
